 "name_en": "Sales Processing using Third-Party with Shipping Notification (BD3)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Sales Processing using Third-Party with Shipping Notification (BD3)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio1f4d37c1854940e6a5430c8b4e9d9e02\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1f4d37c1854940e6a5430c8b4e9d9e02__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item enables you to forward orders to third-party vendors who ship the goods directly to customers and then bill you directly. The standard sales order automatically creates a purchase requisition for the materials to be delivered by third-party vendors. Once vendors have sent a shipping notification, a statistical goods receipt can be posted. Once this has taken place, invoices can be created and issued based on the goods receipt quantities.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1f4d37c1854940e6a5430c8b4e9d9e02__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create third-party sales order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Convert purchase requisitions to purchase order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Approve purchase orders</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post statistical goods receipt</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create billing document</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Enter vendor invoice</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1f4d37c1854940e6a5430c8b4e9d9e02__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduces stock and cost, thus increasing efficiency</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Transfer customer requirements directly to external suppliers</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Invoice from trader to customer, based on quantities from Goods receipt</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Fulfill customer requirements despite material shortage</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>使用含装运通知的第三方的销售处理 (BD3)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio1f4d37c1854940e6a5430c8b4e9d9e02\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1f4d37c1854940e6a5430c8b4e9d9e02__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目允许您将订单转发给将货物直接运送给客户的第三方供应商，然后直接向您开票。标准销售订单自动为第三方供应商交付的物料创建采购申请。供应商发送装运通知后，即可过账统计收货。完成此操作后，可以根据收货数量创建和开具发票。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1f4d37c1854940e6a5430c8b4e9d9e02__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建第三方销售订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将采购申请转换为采购订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">审批采购订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">过账统计收货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建开票凭证</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">输入供应商发票</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1f4d37c1854940e6a5430c8b4e9d9e02__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">减少库存和成本，从而提高效率</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将客户需求直接传输给外部供应商</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">从贸易商到客户的发票，基于收货的数量</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在物料短缺的情况下仍可满足客户需求</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
